  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfRevenueFromContractsWithCustomersTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※１　顧客との契約から生じる収益&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;売上高については、全額が顧客との契約から生じる収益であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfRevenueFromContractsWithCustomersTextBlock>
